[E0436] Error: `name` is used after `names`, which it borrows, was changed
   ╭─[ err/637_what_a_guard_binds_holds_its_place_for_the_arm/main.wip:9:16 ]
   │
 7 │     i if names.get(i) is .Some(name) => {
   │                                ──┬─
   │                                  ╰─── `name` borrows `names`
 8 │         names.push("b")
   │         ──┬──
   │           ╰──── `names` passed as `&var` here
 9 │         assert(name == "a")
   │                ──┬─
   │                  ╰─── used here
   │
   │ Help: use `name` before `names` changes, or keep a copy of the value it points to
   │
   │ Note: a `&` reference points into the place it borrows, so that must not change while the reference is still used
───╯
